# Wave control explained.

- The wave control system that comes with the system is just an example on how the system can be used
you can remove it and the system will still work, however it can be modified to make a fully working system.

- If you decide to look into doing this, please check the related documentation about that.

____________________________________________________________________

- The wave controler system is made up of one central Wave Control Handler as well as a bunch of module
scripts.

- These module scripts are different playable gamemodes, you can code your own logic for allowing for voting
or other features to chose the gamemode, or you can manually set it inside of the script (this is done
by default).

]]